      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat defaults to letting me hear everyone, so the decision to make chatboxes default to \"Friends\" seems like a really confusing choice. Would also be nice to have a different setting for \"chat\" vs \"system\" messages. chat should default to everyone and system default to friends or better yet, off.\n\nBy chat I am referring to messages typed/sent via osc with the final parameter set to true (the one which controls if the sound plays). This would allow people to hide all the messages showing currently playing songs/current local time or weather/whatever but still see when a mute user is talking.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
